<para>Over the next few days, the same 5 friends practiced walking and texting to see if they could walk faster and text
  more characters. They did not record any more data while practicing. After practicing, each of the 5 friends took
  another 4 walks. Here are the results of the final 20 walks.</para>
<para><figure><media alt="A scatterplot. Horizontal, from 120 to 240, by 20’s, labeled distance, feet. Vertical, from 25 to 200, by 25’s, number of characters, texted. 19 dots, trend slightly downward and right."><image mime-type="image/png" src="https://k12.openstax.org/contents/raise/resources/80f714383377d80c86e2118803fac90afacdda3c"/></media></figure></para>
